  speakerName: Aling Rosa
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Now we''re moving into a more advanced part of Ilokano.

    In
    a sentence such as ''Siak ket weaver,'' the word ''ket'' connects the subject
    with the information that describes it.

    Think of ''ket'' as a connector
    that helps link the two parts of the sentence.

    Listen carefully: ket.

    Now,
    try saying ''ket'' yourself.'
